{"server":"tw","storyId":"act19side_level_act19side_04_end","groupId":"act19side","stageId":"act19side_04","title":"無人的小巷","storyCode":"DV-4","avgTag":"行動後","sourcePath":"vendor/ArknightsGamedata/tw/gamedata/story/activities/act19side/level_act19side_04_end.txt","sourceHash":"3dcb7a2f9d7a0aec2da5f5be5b37bada432d23196d95164e4ca43c592d283465","bodyAvailable":true,"summaryText":"城中，塞雷婭正要將動力甲徹底擊潰，千鈞一髮之際，博士出聲阻止，從動力甲中救出了繆爾賽思；城外，一行人終於進入多蘿西的實驗室，拓荒者們卻第一時間將弓弩對準多蘿西。","blocks":[{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_black"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"29_g8_alley_n"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Mechanist","speakerId":"avg_npc_521_1","isRemote":false,"text":"第六具動力甲，確認癱瘓。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"塞雷婭","speakerId":"avg_npc_532_1","isRemote":false,"text":"這些就是全部？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Mechanist","speakerId":"avg_npc_521_1","isRemote":false,"text":"看起來是這樣。他們成功拖住了我們十三分鐘。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Mechanist","speakerId":"avg_npc_521_1","isRemote":false,"text":"等等——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Mechanist","speakerId":"avg_npc_521_1","isRemote":false,"text":"掃描結果顯示，還有第七具！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"奇怪的動力甲","speakerId":"avg_npc_526_1","isRemote":false,"text":"——"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Mechanist","speakerId":"avg_npc_521_1","isRemote":false,"text":"博士小心！它往你的方向去了！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"奇怪的動力甲","speakerId":"avg_npc_526_1","isRemote":false,"text":"——"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"塞雷婭","speakerId":"avg_npc_532_1","isRemote":false,"text":"讓我來。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"你看不清塞雷婭是怎麼移動的，在你的雙腿反應過來之前，她已經站在了你的面前。\n你知道，在哥倫比亞的街道上，她從來不會帶上那面萊茵製造的盾牌。\n她會把自己變成盾。\n從她交疊的小臂上，琺瑯質迅速生長開，替你擋下了動力甲的一擊。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"塞雷婭","speakerId":"avg_npc_532_1","isRemote":false,"text":"害蟲。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"你聽到塞雷婭低聲說。\n她一直這麼看待這些失控的哥倫比亞技術。\n從她的表情與姿態中，你讀出了她下一步的動作。\n在準備消滅害蟲的時候，塞雷婭從來不會浪費時間。\n她的手即將觸到動力甲的前胸，那裡很快就會出現一個黑漆漆的空洞——\n面前這具動力甲會被摧毀，或者說，“死去”。\n一個念頭在你的腦子裡躥了上來。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"choice","options":[{"label":"停下，塞雷婭！","value":"1","blocks":[]}]},{"type":"narration","text":"塞雷婭也許只聽到了你喊出來的第一個音節，但她的確收了手。\n這是你們長期並肩作戰累積下來的信任。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"她的拳頭錯開了核心，可攻擊的餘波依舊震碎了動力甲的上半截外殼。\n從無數飛濺的金屬碎片中，你看到了一抹亮色。\n就像......髮絲。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Mechanist","speakerId":"avg_npc_521_1","isRemote":false,"text":"博士，危險！別靠近——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"塞雷婭","speakerId":"avg_npc_532_1","isRemote":false,"text":"那是......"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"29_i02"},{"type":"narration","text":"動力甲正在倒下。\n更多碎片飛了出來，很快，你看到了更多髮絲，一點皮膚，然後是一隻眼睛。\n那隻眼睛看向了你。\n憤怒，驚恐，迷茫......你在一瞬間讀出了很多情緒。\n而在所有情緒隨著偽裝的外殼一起剝落之後，你發現它在向你求救。\n於是，你伸出了一隻手。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":null},{"type":"choice","options":[{"label":"你好，繆爾賽思。","value":"1","blocks":[]}]},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"29_g4_corridor"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"桑尼","speakerId":"avg_npc_535_1","isRemote":false,"text":"邁爾，這是怎麼回事？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"拓荒隊成員","speakerId":"avg_npc_534_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我不知道......我不知道，領隊......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"桑尼","speakerId":"avg_npc_535_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你先放開摩爾醫生。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"拓荒隊成員","speakerId":"avg_npc_534_1","isRemote":false,"text":"醫生......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"白面鴞","speakerId":"avg_128_plosis_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"拓荒隊成員","speakerId":"avg_npc_534_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我不能放開她。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"桑尼","speakerId":"avg_npc_535_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你不聽我的命令？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"拓荒隊成員","speakerId":"avg_npc_534_1","isRemote":false,"text":"領隊，你為什麼還跟她們站在一起？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"拓荒隊成員","speakerId":"avg_npc_534_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你不是說，我們必須狠下心來對她們下手嗎？你不是說......我們只是她們豢養的實驗動物嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"拓荒隊成員","speakerId":"avg_npc_534_1","isRemote":false,"text":"是你勸我跟你一塊幹的。我本來......我很喜歡摩爾醫生。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"桑尼","speakerId":"avg_npc_535_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......沒想到，最先站出來反對我的人會是你。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"桑尼","speakerId":"avg_npc_535_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我甚至想過會是薩姆，或者其他人......邁爾，你從來都最聽我的話。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"拓荒隊成員","speakerId":"avg_npc_534_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你也說過，我太聽話了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"拓荒隊成員","speakerId":"avg_npc_534_1","isRemote":false,"text":"以前我聽老闆的，在工廠裡得了礦石病......來了這裡，我就聽你的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"拓荒隊成員","speakerId":"avg_npc_534_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你們都是有本事的人，聰明，讀書多。我覺得聽你們的不會錯。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"拓荒隊成員","speakerId":"avg_npc_534_1","isRemote":false,"text":"但現在......我們都要死了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"拓荒隊成員","speakerId":"avg_npc_534_1","isRemote":false,"text":"桑尼，我們都快被這幾個做研究的人害死了！她們還覺得自己能控制一切！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"埃琳娜","speakerId":"avg_135_halo_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"拓荒隊成員","speakerId":"avg_npc_534_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不信的話，你搜一下她，她身上一定有錄音用的機器，她這一路上跟著我們就是為了觀察我們，也觀察那些銀色的怪物！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"桑尼","speakerId":"avg_npc_535_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......烏比卡博士，要是有脫困的方法，你該開口了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"赫默","speakerId":"avg_108_silent_1","isRemote":false,"text":"埃琳娜......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"埃琳娜","speakerId":"avg_135_halo_1","isRemote":false,"text":"奧利維亞，我的確沒有把實驗資訊告訴你......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"埃琳娜","speakerId":"avg_135_halo_1","isRemote":false,"text":"但我絕對不會騙你。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"埃琳娜","speakerId":"avg_135_halo_1","isRemote":false,"text":"桑尼，邁爾，我也沒有騙過你們。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"埃琳娜","speakerId":"avg_135_halo_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我......真的不知道對付它們的方法。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"埃琳娜","speakerId":"avg_135_halo_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我記錄它們的資料，研究它們，都是因為我也想解決眼前的問題......我說過了，這是我工作的一部分。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"赫默","speakerId":"avg_108_silent_1","isRemote":false,"text":"嗯......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"赫默","speakerId":"avg_108_silent_1","isRemote":false,"text":"邁爾先生，我想埃琳娜沒有撒謊。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"赫默","speakerId":"avg_108_silent_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你能把喬伊絲還給我們了嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"拓荒隊成員","speakerId":"avg_npc_534_1","isRemote":false,"text":"哈......哈哈哈......"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"拓荒者盯著白面鴞，突然抬手。\n一聲叫喊凝在了赫默嗓子眼，無人機接收到了主人的意志，狠狠撞向拓荒者的身體。\n可他只是從白面鴞手上取下了一樣東西。\n那是他在幾個小時前親手給她戴上的緊急醫療環。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"白面鴞","speakerId":"avg_128_plosis_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"拓荒隊成員","speakerId":"avg_npc_534_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我......我都幹了些什麼啊？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"拓荒隊成員","speakerId":"avg_npc_534_1","isRemote":false,"text":"摩爾醫生......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"拓荒隊成員","speakerId":"avg_npc_534_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你會怪我嗎？你會不會後悔曾經對我那麼好？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"拓荒隊成員","speakerId":"avg_npc_534_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我這樣的人......根本不配被你拯救。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"醫生回到了她的朋友們身邊。她依然安靜，美麗，無瑕。\n可是所有人都無處可逃了。這座實驗室就是一個為他們提前準備好的墓穴。\n沒有人能得救，這該死的環只是那該死的公司給他們套上的鐐銬。\n他們都得不到自由，除非......\n拓荒者突然把緊急醫療環整個塞進了嘴裡。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"桑尼","speakerId":"avg_npc_535_1","isRemote":false,"text":"邁爾！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"拓荒隊成員","speakerId":"avg_npc_534_1","isRemote":false,"text":"領、領隊......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"桑尼","speakerId":"avg_npc_535_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你在幹什麼？快吐出來！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"赫默","speakerId":"avg_108_silent_1","isRemote":false,"text":"這醫療環......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"埃琳娜","speakerId":"avg_135_halo_1","isRemote":false,"text":"裡面還剩大量止痛劑。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"埃琳娜","speakerId":"avg_135_halo_1","isRemote":false,"text":"一口氣吞掉這麼多，心臟根本受不了，他會休克的！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"拓荒隊成員","speakerId":"avg_npc_534_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我見過......有人偷偷地把這個吞下去......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"桑尼","speakerId":"avg_npc_535_1","isRemote":false,"text":"他們都死了！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"拓荒隊成員","speakerId":"avg_npc_534_1","isRemote":false,"text":"那他們很......幸運。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"桑尼","speakerId":"avg_npc_535_1","isRemote":false,"text":"該死，你給我吐出來！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"桑尼","speakerId":"avg_npc_535_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我按住他的嘴，薩姆，你給我揍他肚子！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"拓荒隊成員","speakerId":"avg_npc_534_1","isRemote":false,"text":"咳咳......咳咳咳！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"桑尼","speakerId":"avg_npc_535_1","isRemote":false,"text":"再加把勁，我看到醫療環的形狀了！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"埃琳娜","speakerId":"avg_135_halo_1","isRemote":false,"text":"奧利維亞，我們一起幫他——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"埃琳娜","speakerId":"avg_135_halo_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......奧利維亞？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"赫默","speakerId":"avg_108_silent_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......喬伊絲。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"白面鴞","speakerId":"avg_128_plosis_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"白面鴞","speakerId":"avg_128_plosis_1","isRemote":false,"text":"——程式啟動。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"埃琳娜","speakerId":"avg_135_halo_1","isRemote":false,"text":"她醒了？！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"白面鴞","speakerId":"avg_128_plosis_1","isRemote":false,"text":"好黑啊......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"白面鴞","speakerId":"avg_128_plosis_1","isRemote":false,"text":"外面......為什麼這麼黑？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"埃琳娜","speakerId":"avg_135_halo_1","isRemote":false,"text":"黑、黑嗎？可是走廊上的燈都開著啊。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"埃琳娜","speakerId":"avg_135_halo_1","isRemote":false,"text":"喬伊絲，你的眼睛......是不是出問題了？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"白面鴞","speakerId":"avg_128_plosis_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......光。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"白面鴞","speakerId":"avg_128_plosis_1","isRemote":false,"text":"想要光......有光的地方......很溫暖。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"白面鴞","speakerId":"avg_128_plosis_1","isRemote":false,"text":"一起往前走......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"白面鴞","speakerId":"avg_128_plosis_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不害怕......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"埃琳娜","speakerId":"avg_135_halo_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你......你能聽見我們說話嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"赫默","speakerId":"avg_108_silent_1","isRemote":false,"text":"她不能。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"埃琳娜","speakerId":"avg_135_halo_1","isRemote":false,"text":"這是怎麼回事？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"赫默","speakerId":"avg_108_silent_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我也不知道怎麼回事，但這不像喬伊絲說出來的話。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"埃琳娜","speakerId":"avg_135_halo_1","isRemote":false,"text":"呃，她的病......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"赫默","speakerId":"avg_108_silent_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我非常熟悉喬伊絲，她手術前後都不是這個語氣。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"埃琳娜","speakerId":"avg_135_halo_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......確實。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"赫默","speakerId":"avg_108_silent_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你很意外。你並不知道喬伊絲身上發生了什麼。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"赫默","speakerId":"avg_108_silent_1","isRemote":false,"text":"這說明情況早就脫離了你的控制。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"赫默","speakerId":"avg_108_silent_1","isRemote":false,"text":"埃琳娜，關於這項實驗......你真的該開口了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"埃琳娜","speakerId":"avg_135_halo_1","isRemote":false,"text":"難道多蘿西真的......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"埃琳娜","speakerId":"avg_135_halo_1","isRemote":false,"text":"無論如何，我都不想看到任何人因為這個實驗受傷，尤其是喬伊絲。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"埃琳娜","speakerId":"avg_135_halo_1","isRemote":false,"text":"也許你是對的，我們本該一起解決這個問題......"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"溫柔的女聲","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"沒關係，埃琳娜，不必再猶豫了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"溫柔的女聲","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"是我邀請大家到這裡來的，無論是赫默醫生還是我的拓荒者朋友們，大家都有權知道真相。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"桑尼","speakerId":"avg_npc_535_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你一直在......監控我們？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"溫柔的女聲","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"我很擔心你們。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"溫柔的女聲","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"在你們停下腳步說話的時候，需要有人替你們關上門......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"桑尼","speakerId":"avg_npc_535_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你擋住了那些銀色怪物？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"溫柔的女聲","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"桑尼，請不要這麼稱呼他們。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"溫柔的女聲","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"他們能聽見。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"桑尼","speakerId":"avg_npc_535_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"溫柔的女聲","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"埃琳娜，親愛的助手，我要再拜託你一件事。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"溫柔的女聲","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"請把大家帶來見我。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"溫柔的女聲","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"你不方便解釋的事情，我可以解釋。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"溫柔的女聲","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"而且......你很清楚，我的實驗室是最安全的。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"29_g3_cottage"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"格雷伊","speakerId":"avg_1027_greyy2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"外面已經沒有敵人了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"格雷伊","speakerId":"avg_1027_greyy2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"大概是都追著領隊先生還有赫默醫生他們走了......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"格雷伊","speakerId":"avg_1027_greyy2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......通訊依然中斷。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"格雷伊","speakerId":"avg_1027_greyy2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"應該是針對所有常見通訊設備的干擾，要是Mechanist先生在這裡的話，說不定還能想想辦法......"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"格雷伊","speakerId":"avg_1027_greyy2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"是誰呀？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"格雷伊","speakerId":"avg_1027_greyy2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"難道是......領隊先生？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"？？？","speakerId":"avg_1027_greyy2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"別動。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"格雷伊","speakerId":"avg_1027_greyy2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"這個聲音......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"格雷伊","speakerId":"avg_1027_greyy2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"瑪麗女士？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"瑪麗","speakerId":"avg_npc_527_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你的記性還不錯。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"格雷伊","speakerId":"avg_1027_greyy2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"您......您怎麼會在這裡？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"瑪麗","speakerId":"avg_npc_527_1","isRemote":false,"text":"那傢伙躲哪去了？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"格雷伊","speakerId":"avg_1027_greyy2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"那傢伙......您是指桑尼先生？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"瑪麗","speakerId":"avg_npc_527_1","isRemote":false,"text":"叫他趕緊給我出來。在一個孩子背後躲躲藏藏，這像什麼樣子？！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"格雷伊","speakerId":"avg_1027_greyy2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"那個，女士，我已經長大了......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"瑪麗","speakerId":"avg_npc_527_1","isRemote":false,"text":"嗯，剛長大。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"瑪麗","speakerId":"avg_npc_527_1","isRemote":false,"text":"說吧，孩子，他們都去了哪裡？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"格雷伊","speakerId":"avg_1027_greyy2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"拓荒者們就在附近的屋子裡......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"瑪麗","speakerId":"avg_npc_527_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你知不知道，當你不好意思的時候，你的耳朵會有反應？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"格雷伊","speakerId":"avg_1027_greyy2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"啊......啊？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"瑪麗","speakerId":"avg_npc_527_1","isRemote":false,"text":"騙你的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"瑪麗","speakerId":"avg_npc_527_1","isRemote":false,"text":"但你也太好騙了點，對吧？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"瑪麗","speakerId":"avg_npc_527_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你最好還是把你瞭解的情況都說出來，這對我們來說都最簡單。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"瑪麗","speakerId":"avg_npc_527_1","isRemote":false,"text":"否則的話，這供電是你修的，你已經能算作妨礙執法了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"瑪麗","speakerId":"avg_npc_527_1","isRemote":false,"text":"要是我沒法把真正的壞蛋帶出去，我也可以選擇帶你走。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"格雷伊","speakerId":"avg_1027_greyy2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不，請不要這麼做......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"格雷伊","speakerId":"avg_1027_greyy2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我、我不想給博士添麻煩。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"瑪麗","speakerId":"avg_npc_527_1","isRemote":false,"text":"那你還猶豫什麼呢？說吧。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"格雷伊","speakerId":"avg_1027_greyy2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"女士，我不確定您會不會相信......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"格雷伊","speakerId":"avg_1027_greyy2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我們剛才被一種從未見過的、會變形的銀色物體襲擊了。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"29_g4_corridor"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"桑尼","speakerId":"avg_npc_535_1","isRemote":false,"text":"所以，她在裡面。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"埃琳娜","speakerId":"avg_135_halo_1","isRemote":false,"text":"是的，這裡就是多蘿西的實驗室，也是整個實驗區的中心。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"桑尼","speakerId":"avg_npc_535_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你確定？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"赫默","speakerId":"avg_108_silent_1","isRemote":false,"text":"桑尼先生，你怎麼了？臉色突然這麼難看......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"桑尼","speakerId":"avg_npc_535_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......沒什麼。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"桑尼","speakerId":"avg_npc_535_1","isRemote":false,"text":"人在靠近真相的時候總是會有些緊張。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"桑尼","speakerId":"avg_npc_535_1","isRemote":false,"text":"薩姆，記得我跟你說過的話吧？做好準備。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"拓荒隊成員","speakerId":"avg_npc_534_1","isRemote":false,"text":"好的，領隊。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"桑尼","speakerId":"avg_npc_535_1","isRemote":false,"text":"烏比卡博士，你能打開這扇門嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"埃琳娜","speakerId":"avg_135_halo_1","isRemote":false,"text":"當然。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"赫默","speakerId":"avg_108_silent_1","isRemote":false,"text":"（埃琳娜。）"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"埃琳娜","speakerId":"avg_135_halo_1","isRemote":false,"text":"（嗯？）"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"赫默","speakerId":"avg_108_silent_1","isRemote":false,"text":"（拓荒者們的神情不對勁......）"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"埃琳娜","speakerId":"avg_135_halo_1","isRemote":false,"text":"（但我們已經走到這裡了啊。）"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"埃琳娜","speakerId":"avg_135_halo_1","isRemote":false,"text":"（奧利維亞，你剛才說服了我。我以為我們都是來解決問題的。）"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"赫默","speakerId":"avg_108_silent_1","isRemote":false,"text":"（我不確定......）"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"桑尼","speakerId":"avg_npc_535_1","isRemote":false,"text":"博士，我們都在等著。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"溫柔的女聲","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"我也是。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"溫柔的女聲","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"各位，請進。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"埃琳娜的手並沒有落到掌紋鎖上。\n但在真正的主人的控制下，實驗室的門還是在所有人面前打開了。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"29_g5_laboratory"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"多蘿西","speakerId":"avg_4048_doroth_1","isRemote":false,"text":"大家好。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"多蘿西","speakerId":"avg_4048_doroth_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我就是萊茵生命源石技藝應用科的主任，也是359號實驗基地的負責人。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"多蘿西","speakerId":"avg_4048_doroth_1","isRemote":false,"text":"歡迎各位來到我的實驗室。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"桑尼","speakerId":"avg_npc_535_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......終於見到你了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"桑尼","speakerId":"avg_npc_535_1","isRemote":false,"text":"薩姆，動手！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":null}],"observedOperators":[]}
